					"text" : "changes from old circular buffer:\n1. data set size counts from 1 (0 = empty);\n2. nth counts from 1 (most recent);\n3. extra inlet to get data size (just to the left of right-most  \"clear\" inlet);\n4. nth no longer updates automatically, only on query;\n5. right-most outlet (4) sends list of elements deleted when new item is added to full buffer, or when buffer is shrunk;\n6. nth and dump outlets send \"bang\" if no data available;\n7. 3rd outlet is now dump outlet (list, most recent first, no longer iterated)"
				}

